### EFF.T3.16  [lemma]

**CANONICAL STATEMENT:**

> “**Section-ratio coboundary.**
> \[
> \frac{\chi(a)\chi(b)}{\chi(a+b)}
> =
> \operatorname{res}\!\left(
> \tau_{\widehat N}(a,b)\tau_N(a,b)^{-1}
> \right).
> \tag{T3-COB}
> \]”

> “In particular, no character law for \(\chi\) is assumed. It is a character exactly when the two imported cocycles have equal residue.”

**DERIVATION:** `[VERBATIM, effective §2.4]`

> \[
> \begin{aligned}
> \frac{\chi(a)\chi(b)}{\chi(a+b)}
> &=
> \operatorname{res}\!\left(
> \frac{\widehat N(a)}{N(a)}
> \frac{\widehat N(b)}{N(b)}
> \frac{N(a+b)}{\widehat N(a+b)}
> \right)\\
> &=
> \operatorname{res}\!\left(
> \tau_{\widehat N}(a,b)\tau_N(a,b)^{-1}
> \right),
> \end{aligned}
> \]
>
> “proving (T3-COB).”

**CONDITIONALITY:** EFF.T3.12; no character hypothesis.

**RESOLUTION TRACE:** effective base §§2.3(3), 2.4; §10 row 6.

**TEETH:** effective §8.2, §8.3(2), §8.4(1).

