> “Because \(\delta\in K^\times\), substitution by \(Z/\delta\) is a \(K\)-algebra automorphism. It preserves irreducibility, multiplicities, and separability. The monic normalization and root correspondence are exactly (T3-ROUTE).”

**CONDITIONALITY:** \(\chi(H_0),\delta\ne0\); monicity where invoked.

**RESOLUTION TRACE:** effective base §§2.3(5), 2.4.

